  <title class="- topic/title ">DLVR and SSC Control</title> 
  <body class="- topic/body "> 
    <p class="- topic/p "> 
    </p> 
    <p class="- topic/p "> BIOS must create a configuration knob to enable/disable option for DLVR Phase Modulation SSC. The recommended settings as below: 
    <table id="TABLE_EB66595154C3454A8E4D898BD1FB41D4" class="- topic/table "> 
